Package: ooat
Version: 0.2.0-1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: openOODA-tools <ops@openooda.org>
Depends: libc6
Description: Single-run scheduled command coordinator backed by transient systemd timer units.
 Capability-bounded openOODA utility with zero ambient authority,
 transient systemd timer unit coordination, and native Model Context Protocol (MCP) surface.
